    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n53120" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κᾰνον-ίς</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ίδος</span>,
			ἡ, acc. to <i><span class="en">
			Suid.
		</span></i>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐργαλεῖον καλλιγραφικόν</span>
			, <i>ruler</i>, dub. in <i><span class="en">
				<u>AP</u>
				6.62
			</span></i> (<i><span class="en">
				Phil.
			</span></i>), dub. in <i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				22.1678.4
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>frame with parallel cross-ledges</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Ath.</u>
				64.2
			</span></i>; <i>door-frame,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				IG
				22.1672.155
			</span></i> (pl.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> in pl.,
				<i>cross bars</i> for strengthening an engine, <i><span class="en">
				Ph.
				<u>Bel.</u>
				57.11
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> pl.,
				<i>profile-stones</i> running along the top of a wall, <i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				22.1666<i>A</i>16
			</span></i>: sg., <i>row of such stones</i>, ib.<i><span class="en">
				1672.186
			</span></i>. [<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῑ</span>
			<u>AP</u>l.c., s. v. l.]</div>
